{"version":1,"key":"card:238","content":{"id":238,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"在 JavaScript 中，每一个函数都会默认的传入一个 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"this","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 参数，它的取值取决于调用方式，而不是所处的位置","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f53b24a4-031f-4066-a854-59333a09efa2","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"function Person(name) {\n  this.name = name;\n  this.getName = function () {\n    return this.name;\n  };\n}\nlet person = new Person(\"Alice\");\n\nconsole.log(person.getName()); // Alice\nconsole.log(person.getName.call(global)); // undefiend","collabId":"091656d1-2b39-45d4-91ce-1c9ccfc0a7b9","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"8ba0bed0-337d-4a48-b514-85c52c9a1c57","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"71fbafbb-e270-42ec-98b0-dcf79dccc1fa"},{"children":[{"text":"因为函数是用户调用的，存在各种可能性，因此当不正确的使用时，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"this","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的值就是不可预期的，产生错误的结果。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6734307a-70ea-4857-a080-2ff750159fc1","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"但是箭头函数内部没有 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"this","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 绑定，这意味着它会在它的作用域链中去寻找 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"this","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，换句话说箭头函数的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"this","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 与其所定义的位置有关，这样可以获得预期的结果，减少出 bug 的几率。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"31355d53-43b9-4ccd-8c3f-3b28a4cea582","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"function Person(name) {\n  this.name = name;\n  this.getName = () => {\n    return this.name;\n  };\n}\nlet person = new Person(\"Alice\");\n\nconsole.log(person.getName()); // Alice\nconsole.log(person.getName.call(global)); // Alice","collabId":"107ba4bd-e37c-4e0e-9c5e-93bb4a17a5be","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"02e15b43-1c61-4e9b-9500-6acfb3e855ba","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"4c05bde0-f578-49d9-873a-e75c52ce898f"},{"calloutType":"info","children":[{"children":[{"text":"箭头函数也可以调用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"call","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"apply","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"bind","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 方法，但是箭头函数内部的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"this","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 取值并不会受到影响。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"148dc50d-2920-4b26-89d2-a7b7b71f2917","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"1904dcea-1ee5-44f9-9ae4-dc833c61ad00","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","title":"","type":"callout"}],"tags":["JavaScript/箭头函数"],"createTime":1690903042855,"updateTime":1793532520708,"linkedCards":[{"id":237,"target":{"key":"card:237","type":"card","id":237},"summary":"箭头函数是 ES6 新增的一种声明函数的方法，箭头函数的声明由三部分组成： 参数列表：使用括号将参数括起，参数之间使用逗号分隔 (x, y) (x, y = x) 箭头： => 函数体：使用花括号括起 const add = (x, y) ...","tags":["JavaScript/箭头函数"]},{"id":240,"target":{"key":"card:240","type":"card","id":240},"summary":"箭头函数与一般函数的不同： 函数内部没有 this ， arguments ， new.target 绑定 不能通过 new 的方式被调用，上文提及过，箭头函数内部没有 [[Construct]] 方法 没有 prototype 尽管箭头函...","tags":["JavaScript/箭头函数"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532520708}}